In article <1991Oct22.235028.5948@mnemosyne.cs.du.edu> janderso@isis.cs.du.edu (Justin Martin Anderson) writes:
>What exactly does blessing armor and weapons do?  I looked through the spoilers
>but could find nothing on the subject.

Blessing armor:  Doesn't really do much, although it _does_ make it harder
for a magic-using monster to curse your armor.

Blessing weapons:  Doesn't really do much against most creatures, although
blessed weapons _do_ fight with bonuses against undead creatures (see
HIT PROBABILITY and DAMAGE sections in the spoilers).

